    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Autonomic Microservice Management via <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agentic</span> AI and MAPE-K Integration
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Esposito%2C+M">Matteo Esposito</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Bakhtin%2C+A">Alexander Bakhtin</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ahmad%2C+N">Noman Ahmad</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Robredo%2C+M">Mikel Robredo</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Su%2C+R">Ruoyu Su</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lenarduzzi%2C+V">Valentina Lenarduzzi</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Taibi%2C+D">Davide Taibi</a>
      
