        Knowledge-Guided Multi-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Agent</span> Framework for Automated Requirements Development: A Vision
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Huang%2C+J">Jiangping Huang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Jin%2C+D">Dongming Jin</a>, 
      
