        <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agentic</span> Enterprise: AI-Centric User to User-Centric AI
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Narechania%2C+A">Arpit Narechania</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Endert%2C+A">Alex Endert</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sinha%2C+A+R">Atanu R Sinha</a>
      
    </p>
    
    <p class="abstract mathjax">
      <span class="search-hit">Abstract</span>:
      <span class="abstract-short has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="2506.22893v1-abstract-short" style="display: inline;">
        &hellip;we take a closer look at the potential of AI for Enterprises, where decision-making plays a crucial and repeated role across functions, tasks, and operations. We consider <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agents</span> imbued with AI as means to increase decision-productivity of enterprises. We highlight six tenets for&hellip;
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('2506.22893v1-abstract-full').style.display = 'inline'; document.getElementById('2506.22893v1-abstract-short').style.display = 'none';">&#9661; More</a>
      </span>
      <span class="abstract-full has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="2506.22893v1-abstract-full" style="display: none;">
        After a very long winter, the Artificial Intelligence (AI) spring is here. Or, so it seems over the last three years. AI has the potential to impact many areas of human life - personal, social, health, education, professional. In this paper, we take a closer look at the potential of AI for Enterprises, where decision-making plays a crucial and repeated role across functions, tasks, and operations. We consider <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agents</span> imbued with AI as means to increase decision-productivity of enterprises. We highlight six tenets for <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agentic</span> success in enterprises, by drawing attention to what the current, AI-Centric User paradigm misses, in the face of persistent needs of and usefulness for Enterprise Decision-Making. In underscoring a shift to User-Centric AI, we offer six tenets and promote market mechanisms for platforms, aligning the design of AI and its delivery by <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agents</span> to the cause of enterprise users.
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('2506.22893v1-abstract-full').style.display = 'none'; document.getElementById('2506.22893v1-abstract-short').style.display = 'inline';">&#9651; Less</a>
      </span>
    </p>
    

