    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Automated Vehicles Should be Connected with Natural Language
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gao%2C+X">Xiangbo Gao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wu%2C+K">Keshu Wu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+H">Hao Zhang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Tian%2C+K">Kexin Tian</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhou%2C+Y">Yang Zhou</a>, 
      
